          "guid": "msmyq8m07g2fs6wn",
          "message": {
            "text": "The invariant is portable, but the golden answer is a host-font fact and therefore remains macOS-only. Chromium 7d859f27 routes Linux fallback through gfx::GetFallbackFontForChar(c, locale) and fontconfig; in the pinned Playwright Noble image, Times/Courier nominate Liberation faces with different literal and decomposition coverage. Keeping noChain === withChain active on Linux preserves the regression signal without grading Liberation against macOS Times expectations. The CI-equivalent container now passes all 10 cases.",
            "markdown": "The invariant is portable, but the golden answer is a host-font fact and therefore remains macOS-only. Chromium 7d859f27 routes Linux fallback through `gfx::GetFallbackFontForChar(c, locale)` and fontconfig; in the pinned Playwright Noble image, `Times`/`Courier` nominate Liberation faces with different literal and decomposition coverage. Keeping `noChain === withChain` active on Linux preserves the regression signal without grading Liberation against macOS Times expectations. The CI-equivalent container now passes all 10 cases."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/primary-decomposition-without-chain.test.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 46,
                  "endLine": 53,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "// Needs the real host font. The chain-membership invariant is portable, while\n// the face/decomposition expectations below describe macOS Times specifically:\n// on Linux `Times` is nominated through fontconfig (the same mechanism Blink\n// calls in font_cache_linux.cc:50-63, Chromium 7d859f27) and commonly resolves\n// to Liberation Serif, whose cmap/decomposition coverage is different.\nconst timesKey = resolveFontKey(\"Times\");\nconst haveTimes = timesKey != null && getFontInstance(timesKey, 400, 16, 0) != null;\nconst isMac = process.platform === \"darwin\";"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
